{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "9f2a865ad74f14e5ee61518ce6f9b16fbe6c49d83fce628ff81b0e749c7574cd", "ja": "羽ばたきは軽やかに", "zh": "振翅轻盈", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7ce744413960225ef37f8b8a8ffe01d2179a4ba18aa9bedad554b8be263e0f66", "ja": "レッスンが始まり、プロデューサーは\n出張へ。美希の気持ちに火をつけるべく\nエレナ達は作戦を実行するが、まるで\n歯が立たず失敗。しかしエレナ達は諦めず、\n「次こそは」と気合いを入れ直すのだった。", "zh": "课程开始后，制作人前往出差。为了点燃美希的热情，艾蕾娜等人执行了作战计划，却完全不是对手，最终失败。然而艾蕾娜等人并未放弃，而是重新振作起来，鼓起干劲说道：“下次一定要成功！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5c250bd08e7673bfd09445f3797d9e347de0c774a00e4c82649afde5b53eb8ed", "ja": "（エレナと美希の新曲公演に向けて、レッスンが\n始まった。初回は、なんとか立ち会えそうだ）", "zh": "（为了艾蕾娜和美希的新曲演出，训练开始了。初次训练应该能想办法到场）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "52eeeaadb0b7c094a15ddb74794efd7b1c38ee105fdcf027cae24975e6e1ec14", "ja": "こんな感じ？\nだいたいはできてるって思うけど。", "zh": "是这种感觉？\n我觉得大致已经做得差不多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "93c5c45f4f09975f7178c27e5af5f29f8bb0cb4fe0b378ff6cb55ee5ce628df9", "ja": "おお～、完璧！　さすが美希だな。\n一緒に踊るとやっぱ参考になるよ。", "zh": "哦～，完美！不愧是美希。\n和你一起跳，果然很有参考价值。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "8d840fe53e1150fa78d2de76d99724caafb38eaa3763647b67b48f9652cbf531", "ja": "エレナさんも……新曲のダンス、\nもう自分のものにしてるって感じですね。", "zh": "艾蕾娜也……感觉已经把新歌的舞蹈彻底掌握了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "9c7ad94b25b410e75f439029638141d54c29b50646b17491705b45c5df89618e", "ja": "えへへっ！　でもまだまだ、\nこんなものじゃないからネ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿！不过这还远远不够呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "8368afe5d0e039b5244b38b6edd235f9b7f20a67d971908f05b5ad2063e961dd", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}から\n見てどうだった？　ミキってばすごい？", "zh": "呐呐，在{$P$}看来怎么样？  \n美希是不是很厉害？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1bd3f7fbfa9a750f93e5e1910ecd60e9d453fc6aea9498dfd9b04c788df4991d", "ja": "ああ、いい感じだ！　ふたりとも、\n今の時点でこのくらいできてるなら……。", "zh": "啊，感觉很不错！你们两个现在就能做到这种程度的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "85a2a84c102afe579a55542e53919589afbd3aff3ae2a965c0e88a7ddf8884fd", "ja": "うん、スケジュールにもだいぶ余裕ができるな。\nこれで心置きなく、出張に行けるよ。", "zh": "嗯，这样一来日程也能宽裕不少了。\n这样我就能放心出差了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "acc41974d51923cc587914fe8240c7757309f118b2878ba7ca59fa924184dcf5", "ja": "あー……。\nそういえばそうだったの……。", "zh": "啊……  \n说起来，原来是这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "cba3d882ee65949f0be17a5f0e198b46d557439588c42bf0f59462339b22046f", "ja": "おっと、もう時間だ。このみさん、\nあとはよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "哎呀，时间到了。接下来就拜托你了，木实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "efb54f16979a35b4ec817dc01d7e24fcddbca8aa8bd8e2e627cf6c5f6b3d14d5", "ja": "ええ、ばっちり作戦遂行……じゃなくて、\nみんなの面倒を見ておくわ。いってらっしゃい♪", "zh": "嗯，作战完美执行……不对，我会照看好大家的。路上小心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "bd998c109f2f7da98b3c6ab44fb987850dd9a921085a606f1a44636ea91451eb", "ja": "うーん……ここのダンスパート、難しいな……。\nこういう時、ダンスの得意なやつがいれば……。", "zh": "嗯……这里的舞蹈部分，真难啊……\n这种时候，要是有擅长跳舞的家伙在就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "cd8f9c7142164b903574293e71cdaef382ecf5df2002078f9f631d22375beb80", "ja": "そういう時は、ワタシにお任せだヨー！\n見ててネ、このステップは……こう！", "zh": "这种时候，就交给我吧——！\n看好了哦，这个舞步要……这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "46517aebbefdc1405041b6d26451feb0ac8fd76ccc39cb0593224d1a6bbfe8ce", "ja": "エレナ……！　もうマスターしてるじゃないか！\nまだ習ってないステップまで、完璧に……！", "zh": "艾丽娜……！你已经学会了啊！\n就连还没教过的舞步，都跳得完美……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "a9f8ce85335e61e18fbfe289657955d8b5754174ea4027775893df12be296bb1", "ja": "これくらいは当然♪　ダンスでわからない\nところは、ワタシにお任せだヨ♪", "zh": "这点程度当然没问题♪　舞蹈上有什么不明白的地方，就交给我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "c2c2e211480a0931d44c5fd29d815bff3d764d64318b7b5b882482d0362d4225", "ja": "さすがはエレナ！　劇場でも\nトップレベルのダンススキルだな！", "zh": "不愧是艾蕾娜！在剧场里也是顶尖水平的舞蹈技巧啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "39e081b5d0734c51047e832bae792de14586d25cb0c5c83c64b84c904f70a34a", "ja": "あの……。こんなわざとらしいお芝居で、\n美希さんが振り向いてくれるんでしょうか？", "zh": "那个……这么刻意演戏，\n美希前辈真的会回头看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "b763926cde7cc4c73349e8e1bd4b7ae3f6604f115d1b661a4b95cbfe186fe3e4", "ja": "エレナちゃんの武器は何といってもダンスよ、\n志保ちゃん。まずはそのポテンシャルを見せつけるの。", "zh": "艾丽娜的武器，怎么说都是舞蹈啊，志保。先让她展现一下自己的潜力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "39729dcc371445946bb378db9aeffefce312b61921f5afba292e142f92b581db", "ja": "そうだな。美希のライバル心に火がつくなら、\n芝居のひとつやふたつ……！", "zh": "是啊。只要能点燃美希的竞争心，演一场戏也没什么……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "41aea3604a6be1c0c68efb407fb476a4021807ce4fe0193cbccbbf532d458b29", "ja": "そんなに、うまくいくんでしょうか……\nあっ、美希さん。", "zh": "能顺利进行吗……\n啊，美希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "0ecd862b2a2d5ae697f866f7cafc4844f806359af7b07da5b1626effff60f997", "ja": "あら美希ちゃん。もしかして、\nエレナちゃんのダンスが気になっちゃった？", "zh": "哎呀，是美希呀。难不成，\n你也在意起艾莲娜的舞蹈动作了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "6f1893a476782620d15772ec0f50f1e679af28f6574c52241df8129d9170e726", "ja": "うん、すごいねエレナ。まだ習ってない\nところまで……えっと、こうかな？", "zh": "嗯，艾丽娜，你真厉害。连还没学过的部分都……呃，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "2d08ebfe5d966f14c98706325866c6146d0120b7107f5b82da2adb466ddd7190", "ja": "えっ！？　ミキ、なんでできるノー！？\nワタシ、覚えるのけっこう時間かかったのに～！", "zh": "咦！？美希，你怎么会做的啊——！？\n我可是花了好长时间才记住的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1024_003mik", "source_sha256": "6bc258dd398bf1545ea19b622b736f793884bc070059c03652d8f981c6246f01", "ja": "前に、似たようなステップやったこと\nあるから。難しいよね、これ。", "zh": "因为以前做过类似的舞步。这个挺难的，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "38f63baed0d6ff638dc9fbd8ccaf23c2a77f136556d576e726620fa7206cdc9c", "ja": "前にやったことが……さすがですね。", "zh": "之前做过啊……真不愧是你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "b4474d2731828259e4b0c157cab13f21b6df5be7efe1b80901ed649d50c404b3", "ja": "くぅ、やられた……ダンスの技量より、\n経験の差が出たな……！", "zh": "可恶，被摆了一道……比起舞蹈技巧，还是经验上的差距更明显啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1027_003mik", "source_sha256": "efb516da1c86e3656767a405a65b55be9010703f09dc103e8f54c164f281a5bd", "ja": "あふぅ。\n今日はたくさん踊って、疲れちゃった。", "zh": "哈啊～\n今天跳了好多舞，累坏了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1028_033sih", "source_sha256": "116b466882c49d404567be038b0c6b8b9565114067adaf1ef4d016c979d7bd22", "ja": "そういえば、今日は休憩してませんね。\nまだ初日なのに、すこし飛ばしすぎたかも。", "zh": "说起来，今天还没休息过呢。\n明明才第一天，可能有点太拼了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "3cb1f13b24025711ca739ae8b6ff7394efc23559d572f3f85e11735728a49318", "ja": "うん。\nだから、そんなに焦らなくてもいいと思うな。", "zh": "嗯。\n所以美希觉得，不用那么着急也可以的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "ed753abef785afdd4ae67e408e7a6459782b34d1a931894d9fe6ad931d89581b", "ja": "難しいステップも、ゆっくりでいいんじゃない？\n無理してケガしちゃうほうがよくないの。", "zh": "有些困难的舞步，慢慢来不也挺好吗？硬撑着把自己弄伤，反而更不好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "4eb0e88e26142d79bc701263c2e940d314dc8aad7ad8658a9b77ab11204f5b78", "ja": "うっ、文句のつけようのない正論……！\n確かに、美希ちゃんの言うとおりだわ……。", "zh": "唔，完全让人无法反驳的正论……！\n确实，正如美希所说呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1032_003mik", "source_sha256": "e43566518e15ba8f76bfcc18b2ea3bdfe7bd7f04019519edebb6832ea5c20d3f", "ja": "それじゃ、休憩にしよ♪\nミキ、お昼寝してくるね～。", "zh": "那就休息一下吧♪\n美希去睡个午觉啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1033_039kon", "source_sha256": "5a3a9021abb65c0c0cc0ce38eef89eb39dd1ed948080f46dcbd2c5d71649ef40", "ja": "ああっ、美希ちゃん……！\nさすが、一筋縄ではいかないわね……。", "zh": "啊，美希……！\n不愧是你，果然没那么容易对付呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1034_018ele", "source_sha256": "66de9d15e97a6b07a28c5199c15aa758c886838c9cfacdd3387197e6ec59a8f4", "ja": "ワタシ、このくらいじゃ負けないから！\n次、がんばるヨ～！", "zh": "我才不会因为这点小事就认输！\n下次我会加油的哟～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_02_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "771a507e1b1b7db864a5af179dd8018370f5794e0357f8320e4c6b56ba90c32a", "ja": "いいぞ、エレナ！　みんなも、\n気合い入れていこうぜ！　ほらシホ、掛け声だ！", "zh": "干得漂亮，艾蕾娜！大家也\n鼓起干劲冲吧！来，志保，你来带头喊口号！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
